@startuml Reply to Message - Sequence Diagram

actor Admin
participant "ContactMessageController" as MsgCtrl
participant "ContactMessage" as Message
participant "MessageReply" as Reply
participant "Notification" as Notif
participant "View" as View

== Show Message ==
Admin -> MsgCtrl: show(message_id)
MsgCtrl -> Message: with('replies')->find(message_id)
Message --> MsgCtrl: message
MsgCtrl -> View: show admin.messages.show(message)
View --> Admin: display message details

== Reply to Message ==
Admin -> MsgCtrl: reply(request, message_id)
MsgCtrl -> MsgCtrl: validate(request)
MsgCtrl -> Reply: create(message_id, admin_id, reply_text)
Reply --> MsgCtrl: reply_created
MsgCtrl -> Message: update(is_read: true)
Message --> MsgCtrl: updated
MsgCtrl -> Notif: sendToUser(message->email)
Notif --> MsgCtrl: notification_sent
MsgCtrl -> View: redirect messages.show(message_id)
View --> Admin: show success + updated message

@enduml
